# The hardware cells' machines, one per line: name, ssh host, then optionally
# the port and the private key. Copied to target/hardware/hosts (never
# committed: an address is not the project's), by hand for a machine of your
# own, or by aws-metal.sh for an instance it started.
#
# name            host                     port  identity
# xeon-spr-metal  ubuntu@203.0.113.10      22    ~/.ssh/omn-metal
# intel-client    root@dedicated.example
